<title>CANADA: CWB details top Canadian wheat importers 1995/96.</title>
<headline>CWB details top Canadian wheat importers 1995/96.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Wheat Board on Thursday listed its largest wheat clients in marketing year 1995/96 (Aug/July).</p>
<p>COUNTRY	WHEAT (millions of tonnes)</p>
<p>China	    4.78</p>
<p>Japan	    1.36</p>
<p>Brazil	   1.11</p>
<p>Indonesia	0.90</p>
<p>Iran	     0.81</p>
<p>United States  0.74</p>
<p>Mexico	   0.40</p>
<p>Colombia	 0.36</p>
<p>South Korea    0.29</p>
<p>Chile	    0.27</p>
<p>United Kingdom 0.20</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
